/api.github.com/users/bencmckenna/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T13:52:27Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T13:52:27Z","body":"Sorry I know this has already been closed, but personally I think allowing any flag combination would be better than forcing a single flag as in the merged PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107808\r\n\r\nI understand the limitation is probably intended to minimize user error, but I've already come across an instance where I needed to convert to a ShaderMaterial just to read and write simultaneously.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027970773/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032546312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107767#issuecomment-3032546312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107767","id":3032546312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60wPwI","user":{"login":"Randehh","id":831493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMTQ5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/831493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh","html_url":"https://github.com/Randehh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.g